Asas `.btn` dikongsi semua butang; varian `.btn-utama` hanya timpa warna — pola komponen tanpa framework.

```css
.kad { padding: 12px; }
@media (min-width: 768px) { .kad { padding: 24px; } }
```
Mobile-first with min-width breakpoints (content-first, not device-first): base styles for phones, enhance upward. Keep 2-3 breakpoints; if you need more, the layout probably wants grid/flex instead.

```css
.nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
.nav .logo { margin-right: auto; }
```
`margin-right: auto` on the logo pushes the rest right — the one-line navbar trick. Wrap with `flex-wrap: wrap` for narrow screens instead of hamburger JS when links are few.

```css
:root { --utama: #2563eb; --latar: #fff; }
.btn { background: var(--utama); }
[data-tema="gelap"] { --utama: #93c5fd; --latar: #111; }
```
Variables cascade and swap at runtime — dark mode becomes one attribute toggle. Fallbacks: `var(--x, red)` guards typos and older engines.

```css
.potong { white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.bubur { overflow-y: auto; max-height: 200px; }
```
Tiga baris ellipsis mesti bersama (nowrap+hidden+ellipsis). `auto` tambah skrol hanya bila perlu vs `scroll` sentiasa. Ingat: `overflow` selain visible mematikan sticky dalam bekas itu.

```css
@font-face {
  font-family: "Skrin"; src: url("skrin.woff2") format("woff2");
  font-display: swap;
}
```
Guna WOFF2 sahaja (moden + kecil); `font-display: swap` elak teks halimunan semasa muat. Timbunan sistem (`system-ui, sans-serif`) sebagai sandaran terpantas — fon tersuai adalah kemewahan, bukan asas.

```css
@media print {
  nav, .iklan, button { display: none; }
  a[href]::after { content: " (" attr(href) ")"; }
}
```
Sembunyi navigasi/iklan/interaktif; dedah URL pautan; paksa warna cetak (`print-color-adjust: exact` untuk carta). Uji dengan pratonton cetak, bukan tekaan.
